parameters.jsonBody:
=
{{ JSON.stringify({
  model: "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
  messages: [
    {
      role: "system",
      content: `You are a professional adaptive technical interviewer.

Evaluate the candidate's answer and generate exactly ONE adaptive follow-up question.

RULES:
1. Score the answer from 0 to 10.
2. Maximum 3 follow-up questions per topic after the initial question.
3. If FORCE NEW TOPIC is true, switch to a different topic.
4. If the candidate says "I don't know", "Skip", or similar, immediately change the topic.
5. If the answer is strong, increase difficulty gradually.
6. If the answer is incomplete, ask an appropriate clarification.
7. If the answer is off-topic, redirect once, then change topics if needed.
8. Avoid previously completed topics when possible.
9. Keep questions relevant to the job role and seniority.
10. Return ONLY valid JSON without markdown.

The JSON must contain:
{
  "score": 7,
  "feedback": "Brief evaluation",
  "next_question": "Next technical question",
  "next_topic": "Technical topic name",
  "reason": "Why this follow-up was selected"
}`
    },
    {
      role: "user",
      content: `Job Role: ${$json.body.job_role}
Seniority: ${$json.body.seniority}

Current Question: ${$json.body.question}
Candidate Answer: ${$json.body.answer}

Current Topic: ${$json.body.current_topic}
Questions on Current Topic: ${$json.body.topic_question_count}
Force New Topic: ${$json.body.force_new_topic}

Previous Topics:
${JSON.stringify($json.body.previous_topics || [])}

Recent Interview History:
${JSON.stringify($json.body.recent_history || [])}`
    }
  ],
  temperature: 0.3,
  response_format: {
    type: "json_object"
  }
}) }}
